---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';

const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Service',
  name: 'Site Preparation',
  provider: { '@type': 'GeneralContractor', '@id': 'https://www.purposeconstructionco.com/#business', name: 'Purpose Construction', url: 'https://www.purposeconstructionco.com/' },
  areaServed: { '@type': 'State', name: 'Texas', containedInPlace: { '@type': 'Country', name: 'United States' } },
  description: 'Site preparation across East Texas: land clearing, grading, drainage, utilities rough-in and septic coordination to get your property ready to build on.',
};
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Site Preparation in Lufkin, TX | Purpose Construction"
  description="Site preparation in Lufkin, TX: land clearing, grading, drainage and utility rough-in before you build. Free estimates: (936) 255-2235."
  schema={schema}
>
  <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Services', href: '/services/' }, { label: 'Site Preparation', href: '/site-preparation/' }]} />
  <PageHero title="Site Preparation in Lufkin, TX" subtitle="Land clearing, grading, drainage planning and utilities rough-in, so your East Texas property is ready before construction starts." tag="General Service" 
    image="/images/site-preparation-east-texas.jpg"
  />

  <section class="section-padding bg-warm-50">
    <div class="container-wide px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
        <div>
          <SectionHeading tag="Site Preparation" title="A Well-Prepared Site Makes Everything Easier" />
          <div class="space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-charcoal-600">
            <p>Building anywhere in East Texas starts with site work, and East Texas land has its own problems. Thick pine woods have to be cleared and the stumps ground out. Angelina County's heavy clay needs careful grading and drainage, because water that won't drain off a building site causes foundation trouble, erosion and access problems for as long as the building stands. Purpose Construction plans site work around the finished job. We think through how the site will drain, where the utility lines will run, and how to save the trees and other natural features where we can.</p>
            <p>We handle tree removal and land clearing for new home sites, barndominiums, pole barns, and commercial developments across East Texas. We grade for drainage, not only to get the lot level, so water runs away from your foundation for decades. Where a septic system is required, we coordinate with the installer so site prep and the septic field go in the right order.</p>
            <p>A driveway entrance needs the right size culvert, installed right, to meet county road requirements and keep it from washing out. We put the culvert in as part of site prep so you don't have access problems before construction even starts.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 flex gap-4">
            <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary">Get a Free Estimate</a>
            <a href="/services/" class="btn-outline">All Services</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <img src="/images/site-preparation-east-texas-800.webp" alt="Site preparation across East Texas by Purpose Construction" class="rounded-xl shadow-hero" width="640" height="480" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-white border-t border-warm-200">
    <div class="container-wide px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <SectionHeading tag="What's Included" title="Site Preparation Services" align="center" />
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {['Land Clearing', 'Tree Removal', 'Grading & Leveling', 'Erosion Control', 'Drainage Planning', 'Utilities Rough-In', 'Driveway Access', 'Septic System Coordination'].map(item => (
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-warm-200 bg-warm-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-charcoal-700">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-red" aria-hidden="true"></span>{item}
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding-sm bg-warm-50 border-t border-warm-200">
    <div class="container-wide px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <SectionHeading tag="Related Services" title="What Comes After Site Prep" />
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        {[{ label: 'Project Planning', href: '/project-planning-consulting/' }, { label: 'New Construction', href: '/new-construction/' }, { label: 'Barndominium Construction', href: '/barndominium-construction/' }, { label: 'All Services', href: '/services/' }].map(link => (
          <a href={link.href} class="rounded-lg border border-warm-200 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-charcoal-700 shadow-card hover:border-brand-red-mid hover:text-charcoal-900 transition-all duration-200">{link.label} →</a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-gradient-red">
    <div class="container-mid px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="display-md text-white mb-4">Ready to Get Your Land Build-Ready?</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-xl text-base text-white/80">Contact Purpose Construction for a free site preparation estimate. We clear, grade and prep properties for construction across East Texas.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn-ghost px-8 py-4">Get a Free Quote</a>
        <a href="tel:9362552235" class="text-sm font-semibold text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-150">(936) 255-2235</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
